  "title": "CRE Team",
  "metaDescription": "CHICAGO, Illinois – July 28, 2026: PPM America, Inc. (PPM) is pleased to announce the recent additions of four new loan originators to its commercial real estate team: Dennis Kracik, Justin Lata, Andrew Lockhart and Paul Mroz. These hires bring the total number of loan originators on the team to 13 and are intended to support ongoing record origination volumes, as PPM sees increased demand for commercial mortgages from its clients. ",
  "description": "CHICAGO, Illinois – July 28, 2026: PPM America, Inc. (PPM) is pleased to announce the recent additions of four new loan originators to its commercial real estate team: Dennis Kracik, Justin Lata, Andrew Lockhart and Paul Mroz. These hires bring the total number of loan originators on the team to 13 and are intended to support ongoing record origination volumes, as PPM sees increased demand for commercial mortgages from its clients. ",
  "heroHeadline": "PPM America Bolsters Commercial Real Estate Team",
  "heroLede": "PPM America, Inc. (PPM) is pleased to announce the recent additions of four new loan originators to its commercial real estate team: Dennis Kracik, Justin Lata, Andrew Lockhart and Paul Mroz. These hires bring the total number of loan originators on the team to 13 and are intended to support ongoing record origination volumes, as PPM sees increased demand for commercial mortgages from its clients.",
